@base = http://localhost:8080
@id = 1

### 생성: 응답 id에 맞추어 위 @id 수정
POST {{base}}/api/study-records
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Kotlin null safety","description":"safe call과 Elvis 연습"}

### 목록
GET {{base}}/api/study-records

### 조회
GET {{base}}/api/study-records/{{id}}

### 내용 교체
PUT {{base}}/api/study-records/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Kotlin functions","description":null}

### 상태 변경
PATCH {{base}}/api/study-records/{{id}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"COMPLETED"}

### 완료 목록
GET {{base}}/api/study-records?status=COMPLETED

### 삭제
DELETE {{base}}/api/study-records/{{id}}

### 잘못된 입력: 400
POST {{base}}/api/study-records
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":" "}
